# Sparkle configuration — committed, single source of truth for public key + feed URL.
# Consumed by Scripts/package_app.sh (writes Info.plist) and Scripts/upload_r2.ts (knows public URLs).
#
# One-time setup (see docs/designs/2026-04-19-sparkle-r2-autoupdate.md §3a):
#   1. brew install --cask sparkle
#   2. Back up Shun's existing ed25519 key FIRST; rename its account to "ed25519-shun"
#   3. generate_keys           # prints Sokki's public key; private lands in default "ed25519" slot
#   4. Rename Sokki's account to "ed25519-sokki" and paste the public key below
#   5. Back up Sokki's private key to password manager

SPARKLE_PUBLIC_KEY=jurBOr9Cc7g9hfFMXhTihrPMIZbDfyLGcTU7D4gx/yw=
SPARKLE_FEED_URL=https://download.sorrycc.dev/sokki/appcast.xml
SPARKLE_PUBLIC_BASE_URL=https://download.sorrycc.dev
